<%= intro %>

<%= verify_note %>

<% if ds_present? -%>
<%= step("Turn DNSSEC off") %>

<%= outage_warning %>

1. Sign in at https://dcc.godaddy.com/control/portfolio and choose **<%= domain %>**.
2. Open **DNS** -> **DNSSEC** and delete every DS record shown. Change nothing else.
3. <%= confirm %>
4. <%= after_dnssec %>

<% end -%>
<%= step("Use Cloudflare's nameservers") %>

<%= ns_timing %>

1. Sign in at https://dcc.godaddy.com/control/portfolio and choose **<%= domain %>**.
2. Open **DNS** -> **Nameservers** -> **Change Nameservers** -> **I'll use my own nameservers**.
3. Enter exactly these two, replacing any others:
<%= ns_list %>
4. <%= confirm %> GoDaddy may ask you to confirm by email or text code.
5. <%= done %>
